      "word": "DEXTRAL",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "Right, as opposed to sinistral, or left. Dextral shell (Zoöl.), a spiral shell the whorls of which turn from left right, or like the hands of a watch when the apex of the spire is toward the eye of the observer.",
          "partOfSpeech": "adjective"
        }
